<title>ANGOLA: Port conditions update - Angola - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Angola - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>Angola, Feb 3 - Tomorrow, February 4 is a public holiday in Angola and port offices will be closed, but cargo terminals in Luanda, Lobito and Namibe will be operating. However, discharge may be reduced due to the holiday. Crude oil terminals operating according to programme with no berthing delays reported.</p>
</text>
